# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Word Ladder = BFS.

✅ Binary Matrix = BFS.

✅ Cheapest Flights = BFS + Cost.

✅ Network Delay = Dijkstra.

✅ Distinct Islands = Relative Coordinates.

✅ Enclaves = Boundary DFS/BFS.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using DFS for shortest path.

❌ Forgetting 8 directions in Binary Matrix.

❌ Revisiting words in Word Ladder.

❌ Ignoring stop count in Flights problem.

❌ Using BFS for weighted graph.

